**Tense Markers**:
```python
TENSE_MARKERS = {
    "present_imperfect": ("a", "-", ""),
    "present_perfect":   ("a", "-r", "-"),
    "past_perfect":      ("ku-", "-", ""),
    "future":            ("wa", "-", "e"),
    "conditional":       ("ku-", "-", ""),
    "imperative":       ("", "-", ""),
    "subjunctive":      ("", "-", "e"),
}
```

